<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <style>
      body { color: #20252b; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; }
      h2 { font-size: 18px; margin: 24px 0 8px; }
      p { margin: 12px 0; }
      .account { border-top: 1px solid #d9dde2; margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 4px; }
      .action { margin: 18px 0 22px; }
      .action a { background: #0875c1; border: 1px solid #075f9d;
                  border-radius: 4px; color: #fff; display: inline-block;
                  padding: 10px 16px; text-decoration: none; }
      .footer { color: #59636e; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 24px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Hi,</p>
    <p>
      We received a password recovery request for the following vpsAdmin
      account<%= @accounts.length == 1 ? '' : 's' %>:
    </p>

    <% @accounts.each do |account| -%>
      <div class="account">
        <h2>Login: <%= ERB::Util.html_escape(account[:login]) %></h2>
        <% if account[:outcome] == 'recoverable' -%>
          <p class="action">
            <a href="<%= ERB::Util.html_escape(account[:reset_url]) %>">Set a new password</a>
          </p>
          <p>
            This link is valid for one hour. After opening it, you will need to
            verify your identity with TOTP or a passkey.
          </p>
        <% elsif account[:outcome] == 'no_mfa' -%>
          <p>
            This account does not have two-factor authentication configured,
            so its password cannot be recovered automatically. Please contact
            <%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@support_mail) %>.
          </p>
        <% else -%>
          <p>
            Password recovery is not available for this account. Please
            contact <%= ERB::Util.html_escape(@support_mail) %> if you need help.
          </p>
        <% end -%>
      </div>
    <% end -%>

    <p>
      If you did not request this email, you can ignore it. No password has
      been changed.
    </p>
    <p>Best regards,<br>vpsAdmin team</p>
    <p class="footer">
      (This is an automated mail from vpsAdmin, your reply will be sent to our support)
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
